; 3_mml_example_d - Mountain King, the bass under the FM lead
; @f3 starts the FM Mountain King at the same 150 BPM; this voice walks
; the root and fifth underneath and both loop over the same sixteen bars.

T150
@p1
@f3
V9
O2
L8

